@startuml "Registration Review Sequence"
actor "Ban quản lý" as Admin
participant "Giao diện" as FE
participant "RegistrationController" as RegC
participant "RegistrationService" as RegS
participant "UserService" as UserS
participant "NotificationService" as NotiS
database "CSDL" as DB

== Duyệt / Từ chối ==
Admin -> FE: Chọn hồ sơ + ghi chú
FE -> RegC: POST /api/registrations/{id}/approve|reject
RegC -> RegS: approveRegistration|rejectRegistration(id, note)
RegS -> DB: UPDATE register_forms
DB --> RegS: OK
alt Hồ sơ được duyệt
	RegS -> UserS: createStudentAccount(email, cccd)
	UserS -> DB: INSERT users
	DB --> UserS: OK
end
RegS -> NotiS: send notification
NotiS -> DB: INSERT notifications
RegS --> RegC: Kết quả
RegC --> FE: 200 OK

== Điều chỉnh trọng số ==
Admin -> FE: Cập nhật scoring weights
FE -> RegC: PUT /api/registrations/scoring-weights
RegC -> RegS: updateScoringWeightsSettings(weights)
RegS -> DB: UPDATE settings
DB --> RegS: OK
RegC --> FE: 200 OK

Admin -> FE: Recalculate scores
FE -> RegC: POST /api/registrations/recalculate-scores
RegC -> RegS: recalculateAllScores()
RegS -> DB: UPDATE register_forms
DB --> RegS: OK
RegC --> FE: 200 OK
@enduml
